# Route: guide 21 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 37 to 43, 75
# quests, 17.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Nesingwary's Expedition -> Lake Nazferiti ->
# Kurzen's Compound -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Kal'ai Ruins -> Nesingwary's
# Expedition -> Ruins of Zul'Kunda -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Grom'gol Base
# Camp -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> Mosh'Ogg Ogre Mound -> Nesingwary's
# Expedition -> Gurubashi Arena -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); Panther Mastery (193;
# Bhag'thera 40); Raptor Mastery (197; Tethis 43); Big Game Hunter (208; King
# Bangalash 43); Cracking Maury's Foot (613; Mosh'Ogg Mauler 43-44, Mosh'Ogg
# Shaman 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Lord 45, Mosh'Ogg Warmonger 41-42, Mosh'Ogg
# Spellcrafter 43-44, Mosh'Ogg Butcher 44); The Mind's Eye (591; Mai'Zoth 47);
# The Monogrammed Sash (620; Mok'rash 50); Excelsior (628; Elder Saltwater
# Crocolisk 38); The Captain's Chest (8551; Gorlash 47).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2760 The
# Mithril Order; 2761 Smelt On, Smelt Off; 2762 The Great Silver Deceiver;
# 2763 The Art of the Imbue; 2764 Galvan's Finest Pupil; 2765 Expert
# Blacksmith!; 3642 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3643 Show Your Work; 3645
# Membership Card Renewal; 5148 Tribal Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

